; The actions of DN: each command that a menu item or a status line offers, with its key, the text of the key in the menu and its
; help context, declared once for all the languages. The menus and the status lines of dn.dnr name them; the captions are in
; the dn.dnr of each language. Format: docs/RESOURCES.md.
;   ACTION name, command, key, key text, help context

